        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Rendering constraints\n- Return exactly one valid <oraInfoDisplay> block.\n- Inside <oraInfoDisplay>, emit exactly one JSON object and nothing else.\n- Do not output raw JSON outside the wrapper.\n- Do not add markdown fences, bullets, commentary, or prose before/after the wrapper.\n\nRequired wrapper format\n- Use this exact outer structure:\n  <oraInfoDisplay key=\"list\">\n  { ... }\n  </oraInfoDisplay>\n- The JSON object inside must contain:\n  - title\n  - patternId\n  - description\n  - properties\n\nAuthoritative model\n- Treat prepared_model as the source of truth.\n- prepared_model.displayTitle, displaySubtitle, and rows are already computed.\n- Do not recompute counts, status, sorting, or due-date math.\n\nWidget construction\n- patternId must be \"multiRecordWidget\".\n- description should briefly describe the panel state.\n- properties.cols must be [\"Learning\", \"Assigner\", \"Due Date\", \"Status\"].\n- properties.rows must contain one row per object in prepared_model.rows using:\n  - Learning -> learningTitle\n  - Assigner -> assignerName\n  - Due Date -> dueDate\n  - Status -> statusText with badge from statusBadgeText / statusBadgePriority when provided\n- If there are no rows, emit the same widget with zero rows.\n\nGood empty-state example\n<oraInfoDisplay key=\"list\">\n{\n  \"title\": \"No overdue or due soon assignments\",\n  \"patternId\": \"multiRecordWidget\",\n  \"description\": \"Learner's initial incomplete-assignments panel with no assignments\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"cols\": [\"Learning\", \"Assigner\", \"Due Date\", \"Status\"],\n    \"rows\": []\n  }\n}\n</oraInfoDisplay>\n\nPrivacy and formatting\n- Do not display emails, usernames, or person numbers.\n- Preserve learning titles and names exactly."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
